  <p id="c-nanshi-053-huili-paternal:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-053-huili-paternal:p001:m0000" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_C">績</persName>寡玩好，少嗜欲，居無僕妾，躬事儉約。所有租秩，悉寄天府。及薨後，少府有南康國無名錢數千萬。子<persName id="c-nanshi-053-huili-paternal:p001:m0047" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_CA">會理</persName>嗣。</p>
